===Upper level===
[[File:Taverley Dungeon dragons.png|thumb|Blue dragons and their eggs.]]
The upper level contains [[blue dragon|blue]] and [[black dragon]]s that can only be killed if they are assigned as a [[Slayer task]]. It can be accessed by the stairs just north of the dungeon entrance.{{Map|2881,9826|mapID=-1|type=maplink|mtype=pin|text=}}

